# Codigrate Autumn
#
# Category: Nature
#
# Description:
# Inspired by fallen leaves and late afternoon sunlight, this theme blends soft parchment backgrounds with rust, copper, and harvest gold to create a warm and unhurried coding environment. Light, gentle surfaces keep the editor comfortable, while deep greens and a quiet teal add contrast and focus to key syntax elements.
#
# For more information about the color theory behind:
# https://codigrate.com

# --- Interface colors ---

# Background uses editorBackground first because Ghostty is a reading surface.
background = #FCFBFA
foreground = #251B13

selection-background = #DFEFCB
selection-foreground = #251B13

cursor-color = #6B9A24
cursor-text = #FFFFFF

